每文件分配给 cjxl 的 worker 线程数。默认 -1，与 cjxl 不传:
Number of worker threads cjxl assigns per file. Default -1, matching cjxl's behavior when this argument is omitted.
  -1 = let cjxl decide automatically per machine (uses all cores, so only 1 process runs at a time);
   0 = disable multithreading (single-threaded encode; falls back to multiple processes in parallel);
 1..%d = fixed thread count; parallel process count auto-shrinks to fit the "CPU cores to use" budget, avoiding oversubscription.
